WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.043 --> 00:00:04.959
Badger and Rat held Toad in his chair.

2
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.700
"Look, Toad," said Badger.

3
00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:11.177
"You will make no speeches."

4
00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:15.090
"You will sing no songs," said Rat.

5
00:00:15.091 --> 00:00:20.309
"Can't I sing one little song?" asked Toad.

6
00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:25.240
"Not one little song!" said Badger.

7
00:00:25.241 --> 00:00:29.072
"We know what your songs are like."

8
00:00:29.073 --> 00:00:32.507
Toad's lip trembled.

9
00:00:32.508 --> 00:00:37.679
"Your songs are full of bragging!" said Badger.

10
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:41.978
"Your speeches are full of boasting!" said Rat.

11
00:00:41.979 --> 00:00:47.259
"Toad, it's time for you to change," said Badger.

12
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:53.568
Toad burst into tears.

13
00:00:53.569 --> 00:00:57.336
Badger and Rat looked at each other.

14
00:00:57.337 --> 00:01:00.951
Toad sniffed and wiped his tears.

15
00:01:00.952 --> 00:01:04.065
"You're right," said Toad.

16
00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:08.611
"I will be a different Toad from now on."

17
00:01:08.612 --> 00:01:13.599
Toad walked sadly out of the room.

18
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.500
He shook his head from side to side.

19
00:01:17.501 --> 00:01:21.070
"Oh dear!" said Toad.

20
00:01:21.071 --> 00:01:25.268
"This is a hard world!"

21
00:01:25.269 --> 00:01:28.108
Rat looked at Badger.

22
00:01:28.109 --> 00:01:31.314
"I feel like a bully," he said.

23
00:01:31.315 --> 00:01:36.832
"I know," said Badger, "but we had to tell him.

24
00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:41.884
We don't want anyone to laugh at Toad again."

25
00:01:41.885 --> 00:01:46.028
"I'm glad I stopped that little ferret," Rat said.

26
00:01:46.029 --> 00:01:49.679
"We're lucky no one saw the invitations!"

27
00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:54.396
"They were awful!" cried Badger.

28
00:01:54.397 --> 00:01:59.097
At that moment, Mole was upstairs.

29
00:01:59.098 --> 00:02:03.928
He sat at a table with letters and envelopes.

30
00:02:03.929 --> 00:02:08.734
He was writing new invitations.

